  "body": "## Changelog\n* 11f0ebb2f818081597b2c8a6b7d23c8a843cc1bb docs(claude): note alternating M4 Pro/Max P-core key banks\n* 479e0ba69be5fd4b317383b638e1ffa9c32d77a6 feat(guess): break end-rise ties by 1 s onset, report aliases and maxima\n* 2461fc0bd9be685fb3e852b162f4f2226b561283 fix(guess): spin S+P threads in the Performance phase on three-tier chips\n* 27f09a92a5c3b967c691abb067abdb9f252d1408 fix(sensors): M2 cluster probes and P groups, M4 Tp1i fabric, M6 SoC fabric, M3 GPU pairs\n* 1a1e122d1d29e749e9d5d89283494c39307acb97 fix(sensors): TCMb as virtual die, M4 Tpx8-D and M3 E-cluster maxima\n* 451f317012f2ce345991f8783e6984e6e9ed96ee fix(sensors): map M6 P-cores as four cores with two probes each\n* 229f97c2faec1951293bd78525b4366bb9e18a50 fix(smc): don't let a parked 40.0 °C slot overwrite a live temperature\n* 57ecc55fafcbcff9f760a28fe413824e8bb7ab71 test(guess): add M4 Pro Mac16,8 saved run from iSMC#28 as replay fixture\n\n"
